ssue between nodes. RBS failures are retried, there is no need to crash the TServer for these types of issues.\n\n```\nThe FATAL looks like it's coming from the CHECK here:\n  for (const string& session_id : expired_session_ids) {\n    LOG(INFO) << \"Remote Bootstrap Log Anchor session \" << session_id\n              << \" has expired. Terminating session.\";\n    RemoteBootstrapErrorPB::Code app_error;\n    CHECK_OK(DoEndLogAnchorSession(session_id, &app_error));\n    RemoveLogAnchorSession(session_id);\n  }\n```\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-18540]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-18540?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"basavaraj29","id":17742021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQyMDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17742021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29","html_url":"https://github.com/basavaraj29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/28830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"co